Getting trough the quest he found a magic marker (0:93) :D yeepeeeh
(Luck is all)

Scorpius couldn't win the battle and was thorn apart from his deadly
magic athame, too easy!

Davy quaffed from every fountain (cursing half inventory before
wielding magicbane again, and never wielding
anything else) and obtained a blessed bag of holding from the third
water demon :)
(he couldn't get sokoban solved alone, and he felt that solving a
puzzle reading spoilers was just cheating)
so that he could turn to gauntlets of DEX not being burdened and had a
spells succes rate boost.
(identify at 0% rocks)

He went back to all seen levels to get potions, scrolls and fire
resistance (i can't believe he hadn't it yet)
He got AC to be -28, and went in *HELL*

He killed a wraith, "you see a lamp" just to identify an uncursed magic
lamp, dark was over around Davy!
On DL30 he finally got fire resistance,waiting for a ring of conflict.
Waiting was too long, so he polypied
until it appeared at his feet.

The planes were just a delay...



